IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cma-types`
IMPORT `cma-definitions`
IMPORT `cma-offences`
IMPORT `cma-punishment`
IMPORT `cma-scope-procedure`

-- Computer Misuse Act 1993 — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.
--
--   "For this conduct involving a computer, does the Computer Misuse Act reach
--    it, is the alleged offence made out, and what is the most it can cost?"
--
-- One answer through the Act: does it reach the conduct (s 13, Goal 4); are
-- the elements made out on the definitions in s 2 (Goals 1-2); what is the
-- maximum fine, imprisonment and caning (ss 3-12, Goal 3); and what follows
-- procedurally — courts, composition, arrest (ss 15, 16, 19, Goal 4).

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Computer misuse position` HAS
    `the offence alleged`                    IS A STRING
    `the Act reaches the conduct`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence is made out`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `damage within s 2(1)`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `a protected computer under s 11`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `maximum punishment`                     IS A MAYBE `CMA punishment`   -- NOTHING if not made out or not reached
    `triable by`                             IS A LIST OF STRING
    `an arrestable offence (s 19)`           IS A BOOLEAN   -- on reasonable suspicion; not dependent on proof
    `most that may be collected to compound` IS A MAYBE NUMBER   -- s 16: from a person reasonably suspected; NOTHING unless prescribed

@ref ss 2-19
GIVEN c IS A Case
GIVETH A `Computer misuse position`
`the computer misuse position for` c MEANS
    IF NOT `the encoded text governs conduct on` (c's `conduct on`)
    THEN REFUSE "the source prints the Act as amended from 30 December 2025; the text for earlier conduct is not encoded"
    ELSE `Computer misuse position` WITH
        `the offence alleged`                    IS `the provision of` (c's `alleged`)
        `the Act reaches the conduct`            IS `reached`
        `the offence is made out`                IS `made out`
        `damage within s 2(1)`                   IS `damaged`
        `a protected computer under s 11`        IS `a protected computer` (c's `protected computer`)
        `maximum punishment`                     IS
            IF `reached` AND `made out`
            THEN JUST (`the maximum punishment for` (c's `alleged`) `, repeat:` (c's `a second or subsequent conviction`) `, damage caused:` `damaged` `, protected computer:` (c's `protected computer`) `, an individual:` (c's `the offender is an individual`))
            ELSE NOTHING
        `triable by`                             IS `the courts that may try an offence and impose the full penalty`
        `an arrestable offence (s 19)`           IS `a police officer may arrest without warrant, reasonably suspected:` TRUE
        `most that may be collected to compound` IS `the most that may be collected to compound, prescribed:` (c's `prescribed as compoundable`)
    WHERE
        `reached`  MEANS `the Act reaches the conduct` (c's `alleged`) (c's `territory`)
        `made out` MEANS `the elements are made out` (c's `alleged`)
        `damaged`  MEANS `damage` (c's `damage`)
